    "body": "I wonder if this can be put somewhere else? I thought in InstantSearch error handler, but that doesn't know local state etc, so would require a dedicated method on index widget.\r\n\r\nI guess this could be problematic if render is called another time after error, with error again, it will again reset. (which is a little superfluous, but still correct)",
